{
    "title": "Steak 'n Shake",
    "description": "Conveniently order ahead for your favorite hand-crafted Steakburgers, Homemade Milkshakes and more. Build your perfect burgers and shakes with the toppings you want. Choose takeout, delivery, curbside pickup or our new car hop option. Use our car hop service by choosing a spot to park in when you arrive. Then, from the comfort of your car, let us know your spot number. We'll bring your order right to your car. Our new Curbside experience lets us know when you arrive so that we can bring your order out to you\u2014hot and fresh. Every order earns points that you can redeem for delicious rewards. Get surprise bonus offers and rewards personalized to your tastes.",
